'''Blanka''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Blanka
|image = E 484.png
|first appearance = [[Warrior of Nature (Easy)]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Blanka is surprisingly fragile, with only moderately high health, a somewhat long attack delay, very fast speed and high damage. His massive knockback count keeps him at bay easily, but his full backswing cooldown allows him to easily wreck havoc, and though his range is rather low, his [[Omni Strike]] hits up to 340, devastating many melee and midrange units with terrifying ease.

==Strategy==
Like [[Mr. Puffington]], the best way to counter Blanka is to use high damage units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or high range units like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]]. Otherwise, spamming [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] or [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]] can perma-knockback him at low difficulty levels.

At higher difficulty levels however, it will be better to nuke him with something like Awakened Bahamut in order to not activate all his knockbacks, as that will cause its DPS to skyrocket.

